Package: burrow-vpn
Version: 0.4.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 5932
Homepage: https://github.com/PMKA/burrow
Depends: libayatana-appindicator3-1, libdbusmenu-gtk3-4, libayatana-ido3-0.4-0, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, network-manager, wireguard-tools
Maintainer: PMKA
Description: Auto-connect WireGuard VPN on untrusted networks
 Burrow VPN sits in your system tray and automatically connects your WireGuard
 VPN whenever you join a network you haven't marked as trusted. When you
 return to a trusted network it disconnects. Includes a settings window
 for managing trusted SSIDs and a first-run setup wizard.
